  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "STAF.UI.API 4.4.5 targets .NET 10. Projects consuming this package must use .NET 10 or above. The public API is unchanged.\n\nDependency updates (previous → current):\n- Selenium.WebDriver and Selenium.Support 4.49.0 → 4.52.0\n- MSTest.TestFramework 4.4.1 → 4.5.2\n- Microsoft.Data.SqlClient 7.1.0 → 7.1.1\n- Deque.AxeCore.Selenium 4.13.0 → 4.14.0\n- Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Json 10.0.12 → 10.0.14\n- System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs is now a direct reference at 10.0.14, replacing the vulnerable 9.0.18 build pulled in by Microsoft.Data.SqlClient (GHSA-846f-f764-76mx, GHSA-2fmv-rv2c-59x7)\n- ClosedXML remains 0.105.1 (already the latest stable release)\n\nTest projects that pin MSTest.TestFramework or MSTest.TestAdapter must move both to 4.5.2 or later. An older pin fails restore with NU1605.\n\nUI and API test framework for Selenium.\nSupports Chrome, Edge, and remote drivers.\nSupports parallel execution and is thread safe.\nSample project and MCP server: https://github.com/sooraj171/STAF.Selenium.Tests",
